# oracle: pair_style mliap model linear with descriptor ace: the linear_ACE_ccs.yace descriptors of the LAMMPS example examples/mliap (Ta, 141 ACE projections) with the example's linear coefficients (linear_ACE_coeff.acecoeff without its element-name line) on a displaced 3x3x3 bcc Ta cell, 10 NVE steps, with the per-atom energy and virial sums
# Native reference: LAMMPS b332f28 built with PKG_ML-IAP, PKG_ML-SNAP and PKG_ML-PACE (the installed binary has no ML-PACE)
# Measured max relative error, engine vs native: thermo 5.2e-12, atoms 9.5e-13.
# oracle-inputs: w277ma_Ta_linear.mliap.model
# oracle-examples: mliap/linear_ACE_ccs.yace
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all
units           metal
boundary        p p p
lattice         bcc 3.316
region          box block 0 3 0 3 0 3
create_box      1 box
create_atoms    1 box
mass            1 180.88
displace_atoms  all random 0.1 0.1 0.1 4928459
pair_style      mliap model linear w277ma_Ta_linear.mliap.model descriptor ace linear_ACE_ccs.yace
pair_coeff      * * Ta
compute         eatom all pe/atom
compute         esum all reduce sum c_eatom
compute         satom all stress/atom NULL
compute         ssum all reduce sum c_satom[1] c_satom[2] c_satom[3] c_satom[4] c_satom[5] c_satom[6]
thermo_style    custom step pe press pxx pyy pzz pxy pxz pyz c_esum c_ssum[1] c_ssum[2] c_ssum[3] c_ssum[4] c_ssum[5] c_ssum[6]
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
velocity        all create 300 4928459 loop geom
fix             1 all nve
timestep        0.0005
thermo          5
run             10
